   "title": "Normal labour: which stage is she in, what do I watch, and when do I act?",
   "lines": [
    "labour = regular contractions causing progressive cervical dilation (Braxton Hicks: painless, NO cervical change)",
    "first check there is no contraindication to labour: see the ABNORMAL LABOUR chart"
   ]
  },
